{
 "id": "7dd3a834-4911-4757-a74e-50b4dd332290",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "I've Become the Target of the Male Leads"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "남주들의 표적이 되어 버렸다"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Became the Male Leads' Target"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "When I came to, I found myself in the body of a notorious villainess—tasked with running a boarding school in a ruined reverse harem romance novel.\nBut this isn’t just any school.\nIt’s a secret facility where troubled noble boys are locked away, doomed to live out their lives hidden from the world.\n\n“You’re the one who gave the order to knock me out earlier, aren’t you?”\n\nAnd now, the first male lead has been dragged in right before my eyes.\nI’m definitely in trouble.\n\nTo avoid getting killed by the male leads, I tried to be friendly—just enough to stay alive.\nThat was the plan.\n\n“If it means protecting you, I’ll do anything.”\n“It’s strange… I can’t stop wanting you.”\n“Say you love me—before I completely lose control.”\n\nWhy are the male leads becoming obsessed with me instead of the heroine?\n\nGetting more involved with them only puts my life in greater danger.\nSo, I made up my mind to quietly run away.\n\n…Then why are they chasing after me?"
  },
